          <div class="viewport-meta">
            <span>Fasor: <strong>Unitario (A)</strong></span>
            <span>Eje horizontal: <strong>Tiempo / Distancia x</strong></span>
            <span>Muestreo: <strong>60 fps continuos</strong></span>
